      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm not exactly sure how this can be handled, but I set the Respawn Height Y to 0. Spawn point is also at 0, so it didn't warn about it, but my only collider is -0.5. Perhaps some sort of the check if the highest-up collider is lower than the Respawn Height Y?",
